    { "f": 156.800, "n": "Marine Ch 16 — Distress & Calling", "z": "海事 16 频道 · 遇险与呼叫", "c": "marine", "m": "NFM", "conf": "std", "a": "Marine VHF", "d": "Lake freighters a thousand feet long pass through the middle of the city on their way between Erie and Huron. Traffic is worked in both English and, occasionally, French.", "dz": "三百米长的湖运货轮在伊利湖与休伦湖之间穿城而过。通话用英语，偶尔也有法语。", "odds": 2 },
